OL,3,GNEWSADelay to surgeon review angers
OL,4,Afamilies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies waiting years for answers
OL,7,Fabout why their children were harmed at
OL,8,Fa major hospital say they are angry
OL,9,Fabout delays to the findings of an
OL,10,Findependent review.
OL,12,FOrthopaedic surgeon Kuldeep Stohr was
OL,13,Fsuspended by Addenbrooke's Hospital in
OL,14,FCambridge in early 2025 over concerns
OL,15,Fthat surgeries were "below the expected
OL,16,Fstandard".
OL,18,FThe review into the operations was due
OL,19,Fat the end of the year, but will now be
OL,20,Fpublished in early 2027. The trust said
OL,21,Fit had apologised to families and
OL,22,Fpatients for the delay.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
